+# Hardened builder host checklist (for producing secagg wheels and signing images)
+
+1) Provision ephemeral, dedicated builder hosts (short-lived VMs) with network egress control.
+2) Lock OS: disable unnecessary services, enable unattended-upgrades, use minimal base image.
+3) Restrict access: no shared SSH keys, use ephemeral bastion for access; enable session recording.
+4) Install reproducible build toolchain and pin versions. Verify checksums of source tarballs and git commit SHAs.
+5) Produce artifacts to an air-gapped artifact repository and store build logs for audit.
+6) Rotate ephemeral credentials after each build; ensure CI uses GitHub OIDC to assume signing role and does not store long-lived credentials.
+7) Run malware/CVE scans on builder image and publish SBOM for builder tools.
